    {
      "id": "claim_a26d1af6cfd6467186a44f53bc43065b",
      "statement": "Invited users are written with no password and an empty profile (filled only when the invitation is accepted), so the user-document schema requires only `_id` and `roles`; demanding password, profile, or team fields would reject every registration and every invitation.",
