      "statement": "`RhAuthService.teams()` holds the caller's own `TeamMembership[]` — not a team's member list — and each entry carries `id.$oid`, `name`, `description`, `role`, and `active`. Navigate with `id.$oid` and pass the whole `id` object to `switchTeam()`.",
