    {
      "id": "claim_cd59461cf0c342499fdd75420b6d4e59",
      "statement": "Team roles are `owner` or `member`, scoped to a team. Owner-gated operations (invite, resend invite, remove member, change role, rename, delete) are shown only when `team()?.role === 'owner'` and the service enforces the same restriction server-side (owner/admin only); owners cannot remove themselves from their own team.",
      "evidence": [
