      "id": "claim_f8a737ba4dea46da86daaa8a9aadd0f3",
      "statement": "Registration creates a team automatically named `\"<firstName>'s Team\"` when a first name is present, else `\"<email-local-part>'s Team\"`; additional teams are created via `auth.createTeam(name)`, which assigns the caller as `owner` and reissues the JWT with the new team active.",
