    {
      "id": "claim_043228b94b1d4a66a641c7c8131e14b1",
      "statement": "Deleting a team is refused unless no other members remain: the service enforces this atomically (`findOneAndDelete` with an `$expr` size guard) and returns 409 when other members remain. After a successful delete the app reloads memberships and, if teams remain but none is active, switches to the first remaining team before navigating to the team list.",
      "evidence": [
