    {
      "id": "claim_b44fdd573d6e469194e61c14d4138e41",
      "statement": "The active team travels in the JWT `team` claim shaped `{ _id, role }` — the same shape as `user.team` on the database document. `switchTeam()` reissues the bearer as `POST /auth/switch-team?delivery=body`, which returns the new `access_token` in the same response with no follow-up `POST /token`, and the session reflects the new team without a page reload.",
      "evidence": [
