    {
      "id": "claim_d63c25d4491348389f5e6985f2b0b82e",
      "statement": "`listInvitations()` returns `PendingInvitation` rows with `email`, `role`, `expired`, and `createdAt`, where `createdAt` is the time of the last send; the team-detail template marks `expired` rows and offers a Resend button on active ones. Sending an invite to an existing member is refused with 409, surfaced as \"This person is already a member of your team.\"",
